  "sourceTitle": "Qwen3.5 9B running as a fully local AI agent on my phone — including code execution and PDF generation",
  "sourceBodyHash": "bf5a2fe8a7c2de3c84676fc20d543fc26bb1d574424e00e18104152a6ad4e4ac",
