  "totalBlocks": 24,
  "translatedBlocks": 24,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a0e31b159515ea4",
      "translationZh": "在手机上运行完全本地化的 9B AI 智能体——LLM、工具、代码执行和文件生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "76bd087e4bae8bd8",
      "translationZh": "我一直在尝试，看看完全在本地运行的 LLM 智能体在手机上能做到什么程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "445cb0533a8a7299",
      "translationZh": "这个演示使用 TensorSharp，在设备本地运行 Qwen3.5 9B IQ4_XS。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1767afcbf51398cd",
      "translationZh": "我给它一个非常简单的提示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8d10b274c5fb5a4",
      "translationZh": "“请找出今天涨幅最大的 10 只股票。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7d0744544ef99325",
      "translationZh": "收到这个提示后，本地智能体会：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aace1dfaa4537b41",
      "translationZh": "推理如何解决这项任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab8fd92f521522ca",
      "translationZh": "在本地执行代码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c325d40c076432c",
      "translationZh": "检索所请求的公开股票市场数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92630d13ebeacbf2",
      "translationZh": "没有硬编码的 PDF 工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9e06b0ec84c7650",
      "translationZh": "智能体会发现合适的 Skill，读取其 SKILL.md，决定如何执行任务，编写必要的代码，执行代码，生成 PDF，并返回文件——这一切都在手机上完成。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cccd33d21e7af448",
      "translationZh": "因此，在本地运行的不只是 token 生成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "20480d79326b05e9",
      "translationZh": "本地 LLM → 推理 → Skills → 工具使用 → 代码生成 → 本地执行 → 文件生成",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f2bc1cd49eacb3b1",
      "translationZh": "模型是 Qwen3.5 9B IQ4_XS，推理由 TensorSharp 在本地完成；TensorSharp 是我的开源 GGUF 推理/运行时项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d27ef6982ea7c9e0",
      "translationZh": "我觉得最有意思的部分是隐私。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d1c82c3542963d4",
      "translationZh": "你的提示词、对话历史、本地文件以及设备上的私密数据，无需发送给云端 LLM 提供商。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "db3c501d86c0b1b0",
      "translationZh": "只有当实际任务需要外部公开信息时，手机才会访问网络——在这个例子中，需要的是股市数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30b851184317443b",
      "translationZh": "因此，AI 本身可以留在本地运行，同时仍能充当有用的智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f53ce3980113565",
      "translationZh": "我认为，这在移动设备上尤其值得关注，因为本地推理可以带来：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73e3f41a39f4f2f1",
      "translationZh": "对云服务的依赖更低",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d28e1b0cf7811244",
      "translationZh": "无需上传，即可访问本地文件和设备端工作流",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30b2331dbb2f6048",
      "translationZh": "我很好奇，这里的大家如何看待设备端本地智能体的未来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acbe5b2c63f0db01",
      "translationZh": "你认为 7B–12B 量化模型是否已经足以在手机上执行实用的自主工作流，还是我们主要仍在等待更好的模型和更高的移动设备内存带宽？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
